ot;,sans-serif">Fee Payment</span></b><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;line-=
height:105%">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">I will wait to hear=
 from you prior to proceeding with the collection and review of these recor=
ds. If you decide to pay the $572.50, we will send you instructions on subm=
itting payment.&nbsp;Let me know if you have
 any questions. If you would like to narrow your request (for example by us=
ing a shorter date range, by searching only particular employee records, or=
 by adding search terms), I would be happy to work with you.<o:p></o:p></sp=
an></p>
